# Pi runtime copies -- /sync mirrors src/lib/pi-bot/ into ~/secure-pi-bot/{main.py,scripts,modules}.
# Ignoring these root-level paths keeps `git status` clean ON THE PI (the dashboard
# side never has them). Anchored to repo root so src/lib/pi-bot/ stays tracked.
/main.py
/scripts/
/modules/